{"title":"Desert Wolf","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 25 Desert Wolf that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: packDamagePerAlly: .1</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/wolf-sinew\">Wolf Sinew</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf?lv=26\">Lv 26 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf?lv=25\" title=\"Pick level 25\"><td><b>25</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>89</td><td>18.3</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 25.6 · 3,750</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Marauder%20Warcamp\">Marauder Warcamp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>26</b></td><td>94</td><td>18.8</td><td>1,300</td><td class=\"muted\">282 · 26.3 · 3,900</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Marauder%20Warcamp\">Marauder Warcamp</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"desert-wolf\" data-map-level=\"26\">Show level 26 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"sunbleached-fang\" title=\"Sunbleached Fang - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 8 total, 8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/87ff80ab6feed9f385f8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sunbleached Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"jackal-pelt\" title=\"Jackal Pelt - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 4 total, 4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a527c3adeb957a426463.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Jackal Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wolf-meat\" title=\"Wolf Meat - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3754737ea3fb2fec593a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Scorpion%20Pits\">Scorpion Pits</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 35 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Raider%20Camp\">Raider Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 7 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Marauder%20Warcamp\">Marauder Warcamp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"desert-wolf\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Desert Wolf: <a href=\"#/monster/sand-jackal\">Sand Jackal</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha\">Dune Alpha</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/c329d1e5ab8da9dd114c.webp\" alt=\"Desert Wolf\"></div><h3>Desert Wolf</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>26</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 25)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Desert Wolf</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>94</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>18.8</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,300</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.0 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>46 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}